  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A kind of fascination held me where I stood.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I was a battleground of fear and curiosity.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 4.625,
      "seconds": 3.37
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Whatever they were doing down there, they were doing it without a thought of us.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 9.125,
      "seconds": 4.67
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nothing climbed out to meet us. Something down there put up an eye.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 15.125,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "One man stood near me. I knew his face from my road, and not his name.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 26.458,
      "seconds": 5.4
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbour",
      "text": "What ugly brutes. Good God, what ugly brutes.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 32.958,
      "seconds": 3.31
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Did you see a man in the pit? Did anybody fetch him out?",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 37.375,
      "seconds": 3.78
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He gave me no answer. We stood together, and that was some comfort.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 42.292,
      "seconds": 4.54
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The sunset faded. My neighbour went off towards the crowd at Woking without a word.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 48.958,
      "seconds": 5.75
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The little knot on our own side broke up and went off to supper.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 56.042,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Their mirror turned above the heaps all evening and watched what we did.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 61.667,
      "seconds": 4.17
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The quiet was what gave them courage. I could not tell if it gave me any.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 67.75,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_newspaper_boy",
      "text": "They are all in close now. Nobody is minding a barrow tonight.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 73.375,
      "seconds": 3.75
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had walked out to see the thing. That was my whole excuse.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 82.167,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I did not decide to go in. I only stopped deciding to stay back.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 88.292,
      "seconds": 4.9
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Out of Horsell came a handful of men, the first of them waving something white.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 95.125,
      "seconds": 5.75
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A tablecloth on a pole: our argument that we could be talked to.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 102.0,
      "seconds": 4.36
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A hissing came across the heather, so faint I thought it was my ears.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 111.583,
      "seconds": 4.75
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The hissing became a humming, and a humped shape came out of the sand.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 118.042,
      "seconds": 4.98
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Ogilvy was out there, and Stent, and Henderson. I only learned that afterwards.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 124.333,
      "seconds": 6.04
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I watched them go down and did not know I was watching death.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 131.708,
      "seconds": 4.2
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A horse screamed in the pits and stopped. The heat came between me and them.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 137.208,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Had it swung a yard further round, it would have had me where I stood.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 144.375,
      "seconds": 4.76
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Fear fell on me from outside. I ran, and did not look back.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 150.458,
      "seconds": 5.26
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbour",
      "text": "What ugly brutes. Good God, what ugly brutes.",
      "shot": 27,
      "at": 157.833,
      "seconds": 3.32
    }
  ]
}